    "note": [
        {
            "structuredValue": [],
            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "This project aims to address sustainable wastewater management and agriculture by improving technologies and developing mechanistic models to optimize nutrient phosphorus recovery from concentrated waste streams (e.g., municipal wastewater and urine) and produce controlled release fertilizers for commercial markets. By characterizing the struvite-based minerals we will gain insight into their solubility and reactivity, which is useful information when determining which phase(s) is(are) more favorable for reuse as a fertilizer as well as determining how to optimize process controls.",
